# Optional: default Plusvibe API key used server-side when a request does not
# supply one via the UI. The key grants access to ALL workspaces under the
# Plusvibe account, so treat it as a secret. Leave unset to require users to
# enter their key in the app (stored only in their browser).
#
# Get a key at https://app.plusvibe.ai/v2/settings/api-access/ (Business plan).
PLUSVIBE_API_KEY=
